     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in\">D-RUGgies,</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in\">Datalab is offering a four-day workshop next week to teach folks how to use R, Git/Github, and the command line in your research. It&#39;s free to register so join us! Details are below.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in\">-W</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in\"><b style=\"font-size:12px\"><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></b></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\">Introduction to Collaborative and Reproducible Research Practices with R (9/12-15)</span></b></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:white;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:white;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\">This four-day in person workshop series (9/12, 9/13, 9/14, 9/15) at <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465075918000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Wp1PqpXJ1IFLgZH_aMlyN\">UC\r\n Davis DataLab</a> provides an introduction to coding, with an emphasis on leveraging open source tools to develop workflows for collaborative and reproducible research. The goal of this series is to increase research integrity via exposure to basic command\r\n line tools and version control (Git), collaborative cloud tools (GitHub), programming (R), and data and software management best practices. Materials build across the sessions and attendance at all is required. All UC Davis graduate students and postdocs with\r\n little to no prior programming experience are eligible to apply. Upon successful completion of the series and additional assessments, UC Davis graduate students and postdocs are eligible to claim 3 badges through the <a href=\"https://gradpathways.ucdavis.edu/research-computing-pathway\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gradpathways.ucdavis.edu/research-computing-pathway&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465075918000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EyynnSILtu85DQDkOfqFZ\">Research\r\n Computing</a> GradPathways credential program.</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:white;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:white;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-collaborative-and-reproducible-research-practices-with-r-part-1-of-4/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-collaborative-and-reproducible-research-practices-with-r-part-1-of-4/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465075918000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1M-BmN1cziecWQ-rMAqh18\">Space\r\n is limited so register now!</a></span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"> </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:16pt\">Stay Connected<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Want to receive our newsletter and information about other upcoming workshops, jobs and grants, and other opportunities? </span><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/mailing-list/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/mailing-list/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465075918000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1BYBBTQ4_x1wlbtzJOKmmT\">Sign\r\n up for our mailing list!</a></span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> And check out our <b><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/research-and-learning-clusters/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/research-and-learning-clusters/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465075918000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WcffB9WXgpxy5TX7s1nqW\">Research and Learning Clusters</a></b>,\r\n including the Davis R Users Group, Python Users Group, our new Julia Users Group, and more!<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Questions?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> Email <a href style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">datalab-...@ucdavis.edu</a>.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
